  "title": "creem 提现支付宝一次成功",
  "author": "祥子",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kdayqrotkb_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [],
  "content": "<div>creem 后台申请提现后</div>\n<div>支付宝会收到短信提醒：</div>\n<div>【支付宝】#紧急#支付宝账号*，你有一笔来自<em>rmitage Labs OÜ的境外汇款，请尽快点击<a href=\"https://t.tb.cn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://t.tb.cn/</a></em>*** 或搜索【闪速收款】选择收款方式接收，过期将导致款项被退回。</div>\n<div>点击同意后，需要提交资金来源性质，<strong>必须 24h 内提交</strong></div>\n<div>【支付宝】支付宝账号.<em>，你有一笔来自</em>rmitage Labs OÜ的境外汇款，需申报资金来源性质，请尽快点击<a href=\"https://t.tb.cn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://t.tb.cn/</a>***** 或搜索【闪速收款】完善信息，过期将导致款项被退回。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">我准备了 5 份资料：</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>creem商户说明，地址<a href=\"https://www.creem.io/terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.creem.io/terms</a> ，截长图提交</li>\n<li>creem个人数字化订阅服务协议，ai 写的，附件有模板</li>\n<li>creem 后台发票，<a href=\"https://www.creem.io/dashboard/balances/payouts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.creem.io/dashboard/balances/payouts</a>\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kdayqrotkb_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></li>\n<li>creem后台收款记录截图，<a href=\"https://www.creem.io/dashboard/balances/activity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.creem.io/dashboard/balances/activity</a>\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kdayqrotkb_img2.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></li>\n<li>creem支付收款账户截图，<a href=\"https://beneficiary-hub.paysway.io/sessions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://beneficiary-hub.paysway.io/sessions/</a>***\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kdayqrotkb_img3.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></li>\n</ol>\n<div><strong>最多只能提交 5 张图片</strong></div>\n<div>creem个人数字化订阅服务协议模板：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>好，下面我直接给你一份 「可直接用、针对 </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">+</span><span> 订阅收入、适配支付宝闪电收款审核」的《个人服务协议》模板（中英文对照）。\n</span><span>你只需要 复制 → 填姓名 → 导出 </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">PDF</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> 截图 → 上传支付宝 即可。\n</span>\n⸻\n\n个人数字化订阅服务协议\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Personal</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Digital</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Subscription</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Service</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Agreement</span><span>\n</span>\n⸻\n\n一、协议主体\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Parties</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>甲方（平台方 </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> 服务接收方）：\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Inc</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token property-access\">（Creem</span><span> 平台运营主体）\n</span>\n乙方（服务提供方）：\n姓名：__________\n国籍：中国\n<span>身份：中国个人用户 </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> 自由职业者\n</span>\n⸻\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Party</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">A</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Inc</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Operator</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">of</span><span> the </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> platform</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Party</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">B</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">Name</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> __________\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">Nationality</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">China</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">Identity</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Individual</span><span> user </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Freelancer</span><span>\n</span>\n⸻\n\n二、服务内容\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Service</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Description</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>乙方通过 </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> 平台，向全球用户提供 数字化订阅服务，包括但不限于：\n</span>\t•\t软件或在线工具的订阅使用权\n\t•\t数字化内容订阅（如功能服务、在线内容、会员权限等）\n\t•\t与订阅相关的技术支持与维护服务\n\n乙方以个人身份独立提供上述服务，不构成雇佣关系。\n\n⸻\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Party</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">B</span><span> provides digital subscription</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>based services to global users via the </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> platform</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span> including but not limited to</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span>\n</span><span>\t•\t</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Subscription</span><span> access to software or online tools\n</span><span>\t•\t</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Digital</span><span> content or membership subscriptions\n</span><span>\t•\t</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Technical</span><span> support and maintenance related to the subscription services\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Party</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">B</span><span> provides services independently </span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">as</span><span> an individual</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span> and no employment relationship is formed</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token property-access\">⸻</span><span>\n</span>\n三、结算与付款方式\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Payment</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&amp;</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Settlement</span><span>\n</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">1.</span><span>\t用户通过 </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> 平台订阅并支付服务费用；\n</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">2.</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> 按平台规则对订阅收入进行统计与结算；\n</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">3.</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> 定期将乙方应得的服务收入支付给乙方指定的收款账户（如支付宝）。\n</span>\n该收入性质为 个人提供数字化订阅服务所取得的服务收入。\n\n⸻\n\n<span>\t</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">1.</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Users</span><span> subscribe and pay </span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">for</span><span> services through the </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> platform</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">2.</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> calculates and settles subscription revenue according to platform rules</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">3.</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> periodically pays </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Party</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">B</span><span>’s service income to the designated receiving </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">account</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>e</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">g</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span> </span><span class=\"token property-access maybe-class-name\">Alipay</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token property-access maybe-class-name\">The</span><span> income is classified </span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">as</span><span> service income </span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">from</span><span> providing digital subscription services</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token property-access\">⸻</span><span>\n</span>\n四、协议期限\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Term</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>本协议自乙方注册并使用 </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> 平台起生效，\n</span>在乙方持续通过平台提供订阅服务期间长期有效。\n\n⸻\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">This</span><span> agreement becomes effective upon </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Party</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">B</span><span>’s registration and use </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">of</span><span> the </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> platform and remains valid </span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">for</span><span> the duration </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">of</span><span> service provision</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token property-access\">⸻</span><span>\n</span>\n五、税务与合规说明\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Tax</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&amp;</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Compliance</span><span>\n</span>\n乙方确认其为中国个人用户，\n并理解其订阅服务收入需根据中国相关法律法规自行申报和履行税务义务。\n\n⸻\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Party</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">B</span><span> acknowledges being an individual user </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">in</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">China</span><span> and understands that tax obligations shall be fulfilled </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">in</span><span> accordance </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">with</span><span> applicable laws and regulations</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token property-access\">⸻</span><span>\n</span>\n六、其他\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Miscellaneous</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>本协议用于说明乙方与 </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> 平台之间的服务关系，\n</span>作为乙方跨境收款及资金来源合规说明文件使用。\n\n⸻\n\n<span></span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">This</span><span> agreement is used to describe the service relationship between </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Party</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">B</span><span> and the </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> platform and serves </span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">as</span><span> a supporting </span><span class=\"token dom\" style=\"color: rgb(238, 153, 0);\">document</span><span> </span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">for</span><span> cross</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>border payment compliance</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token property-access\">⸻</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>乙方签名 </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Party</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">B</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Signature：</span><span>\n</span>\n⸻\n\n<span>日期 </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> </span><span class=\"token known-class-name\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">Date</span><span>：\n</span>\n⸻\n\n⸻\n\n✅ 使用说明（很重要）\n\n你这样操作，成功率最高：\n<span>\t</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">1.</span><span>\t把上面内容复制到 </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Word</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">WPS</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Google</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Docs</span><span>\n</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">2.</span><span>\t填上你的 真实姓名\n</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">3.</span><span>\t导出 </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">PDF</span><span>\n</span><span>\t</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">4.</span><span>\t上传支付宝时，同时再附一张 </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> 后台订阅收入截图\n</span>\n支付宝备注建议写：\n\n<span>通过 </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Creem</span><span> 平台向海外用户提供数字化订阅服务，收入为平台结算的服务收入。\n</span>\n⸻\n\n⚠️ 小提醒（审核关键点）\n\t•\t✅ 不需要盖章\n\t•\t✅ 不需要公司\n\t•\t✅ 中文即可（中英对照更稳）\n<span>\t•\t❌ 不要写“投资 </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> 分红 </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> 转账”\n</span>\n⸻</code></div></pre>",
